#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:mail.template,body_html:no_rfq_follow_up.template_rfq_reminder_3
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        This is a final reminder regarding our Request for Quotation\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>,\n"
"        which remains unanswered.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        If we do not hear back from you shortly, we will need to source this\n"
"        purchase elsewhere. We would much rather work with you — please\n"
"        send your quotation, or let us know your situation, today.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Reply to this email or contact\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Best regards,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        您好，<t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>，\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        这是关于我们询价单\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>\n"
"        的最终提醒，该询价单至今仍未得到回复。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        如果我们近期仍未收到您的回复，将不得不另寻供应商。\n"
"        我们非常希望继续与您合作——请尽快发送您的报价，或告知我们您目前的情况。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        请回复此邮件或联系\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        此致，\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:mail.template,body_html:no_rfq_follow_up.template_rfq_reminder_2
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        We are still awaiting your response to our Request for Quotation\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        To keep this purchase on schedule, we would appreciate receiving your\n"
"        quotation as soon as possible. If you are unable to quote, a quick note\n"
"        letting us know would be very helpful.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Please reply to this email or contact\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Best regards,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        您好，<t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>，\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        我们仍在等待您对询价单\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>\n"
"        的回复。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        为确保本次采购按计划进行，烦请尽快提供您的报价。\n"
"        如您暂时无法报价，请简短回复告知我们，将对我们帮助很大。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        请回复此邮件或联系\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        此致，\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:mail.template,body_html:no_rfq_follow_up.template_rfq_reminder_1
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        We recently sent you our Request for Quotation\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>\n"
"        and wanted to follow up to see whether you have had a chance to review it.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        We have not received your quotation yet. Could you share your pricing,\n"
"        lead time and availability when convenient? Simply reply to this email\n"
"        or get in touch with\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Thank you — we look forward to working with you.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Best regards,\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        您好，<t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\">there</t>，\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        我们近期向您发送了询价单\n"
"        <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">P00001</span>，\n"
"        想跟进确认您是否有机会查阅。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        我们尚未收到您的报价。方便时能否提供您的报价、\n"
"        交货期及货品供应情况？直接回复此邮件\n"
"        或联系\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"        即可。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        感谢您——期待与您合作。\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        此致，\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or object.company_id.name or ''\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:no_rfq_follow_up.field_purchase_order__x_rfq_reminder_enabled
msgid "Auto-Chase Vendor"
msgstr "自动跟催供应商"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:no_rfq_follow_up.res_config_settings_view_form_rfq_follow_up
msgid ""
"Automatically email vendors an escalating reminder while a sent RFQ stays "
"unanswered"
msgstr "当已发送的询价单未得到回复时，自动向供应商发送逐步升级的提醒邮件"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_purchase_order__x_rfq_reminder_sent
msgid ""
"Comma-separated tokens marking which follow-up reminders have already fired "
"for this RFQ (e.g. 'r1,r2'). Used by the daily cron to avoid sending the "
"same reminder twice."
msgstr ""
"以逗号分隔的标记，用于记录已针对本询价单发送过的跟进提醒（例如 'r1,r2'）。"
"每日计划任务通过此字段避免重复发送相同的提醒。"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model,name:no_rfq_follow_up.model_res_config_settings
msgid "Config Settings"
msgstr "配置设置"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_res_config_settings__x_rfq_reminder_offset_3
msgid ""
"Days after an RFQ is sent before the final follow-up email is sent, with the"
" buyer copied in. Should be larger than the second reminder."
msgstr ""
"询价单发出后，发送最终跟进邮件（并抄送采购员）所需等待的天数。"
"该值应大于第二次提醒的间隔天数。"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_res_config_settings__x_rfq_reminder_offset_1
msgid ""
"Days after an RFQ is sent before the first (gentle) follow-up email is sent "
"to the vendor."
msgstr "询价单发出后，向供应商发送第一封（温和）跟进邮件所需等待的天数。"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_rfq_follow_up.field_res_config_settings__x_rfq_reminder_offset_2
msgid ""
"Days after an RFQ is sent before the second (firm) follow-up email is sent. "
"Should be larger than the first reminder."
msgstr ""
"询价单发出后，发送第二封（正式）跟进邮件所需等待的天数。"
"该值应大于第一次提醒的间隔天数。"

#. module: no_rfq_follow_up
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:no_rfq_follow_up.field_purchase_order__display_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:no_rfq_follow_up.field_res_config_settings__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "显示名称"

